      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.crisis.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.direction.character.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.crisis.asset.sprite.character",
        "actorId": "cassim-bell",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付台に、見慣れない機械が置かれていた。『自動受付一号・見本機』。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カシムさんの椅子の隣じゃなく、椅子の上に。業者が伝票を読み上げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「撤去予定の備品は、そちらの受付係さんです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.001d",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.001d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——黒い角封筒が届いたのは、その三時間後だった。事後承諾の書式は、今日も丁寧だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社にとって、カシムさんの受付は「資産」で、丁寧さは「非効率」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "らしい。翌週、保管庫の受付に、ぴかぴかの自動応答機が設置された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "結果は、三日で大惨事になった。応答機は竜の靴の「左右」を理解できず、月へ誤配送した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "しゃべる冠の苦情を「雑音」として切り、紛失届には「型番をご入力ください」を三百回。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そしてカシムさんは——夜中にこっそり、無給で窓口に立っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "応答機の後始末を、誰にも言わずに。見つけた時、彼の連続勤務はまた五十時間を超えていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……言えば、止められると思ったので。ですが、月へ誤配送された靴が、泣くのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私が受付した子です。私が、直さなければ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "求人票、第一条。「受付は、してはいけません」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "——違反です。罰として、十五分の休止を命じます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "い、今ですか。窓口が、この状態で。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……私が止まれば、七世界が——"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "困りません。それを今から、証明します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は受付台に、あの埃をかぶった休止札を立てた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「休止中。受付係は、十五分後に戻ります」そして手書きで一行、足した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お急ぎでない方は、そのままお待ちください。この窓口の係は、待つ価値があります」",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "棚の陰。砂時計を三回ひっくり返すぶんの、十五分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カシムさんは最初の五分を「列が」「誤配送が」とそわそわ費やした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次の五分は耳が窓口を気にし、最後の五分で初めてそちらを見てた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "列は、崩れていなかった。お客様たちは休止札を読み、静かに並び直してた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "竜の騎士は床に座って冠と談笑し、お姫様は本を読み始めた。誰も、怒っていなかった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……待って、くれるのですね。……私が休んでも、世界は、終わらない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "終わりません。だって、あの列の全員、あなたのファンですよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "機械じゃなくて、あなたに受付してほしくて並んでるんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "十五分後、窓口へ戻った彼を、列全体が小さな拍手で迎えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自動応答機は、その日のうちに「両替専用機」へ降格になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.014c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.014c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "両替は、得意らしい。適材適所、というやつだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.crisis.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "残る相手は、会社だ。「人的受付の廃止」を、書類ごとひっくり返す方法を決める。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cassim-bell.crisis.choice.001",
          "label": "倉庫から失われた世界の出口を一つ開ける",
          "result": "監査が来た日、カシムさんは静かに扉を一枚、風の吹く野原へ開けた。「この世界の受付は、型番では、できません」監査員は野原の風に三分打たれ、報告書に「自動化は不可能、理由は世界」と書いた",
          "intent": "受付という仕事の本当の中身を見せる",
          "promise": "危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "「理由: 世界」の報告書を、チームは殿堂入りさせたがっている。",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
